Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Mysterious Manor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 42
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We must get justice for Queen Nuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.86,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice! We want justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t act rashly, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Taste the power of our silt!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What misunderstandings do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.03,0:00:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch what I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.16,0:00:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao has been captured by Mentor Mei Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.84,0:00:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:00:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mei Huahua…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was taking a walk in the woods…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you’d better just stay right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao is trapped inside a Flower-Cage Plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.04,0:01:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this place to Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.28,0:01:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re going to save Lan Baobao.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Pink
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.01,0:01:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,will definitely get those two fragments before Weslie and Wolffy do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My kids will definitely stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.01,0:01:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That intruder named Sparky has already dissipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.17,0:01:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, dissipated?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to Sparky?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What other tricks do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t lost yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:01:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a sudden gust of wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that’s the suction from the Bottomless Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s been sucked into the Bottomless Abyss; he can’t come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What “Bottomless Abyss”?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That place is a one-way trip—there’s no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better not try to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the fragment in Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi is still guarding the fragment at Goats’ Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We won’t give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.98,0:02:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I’m back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren’t you guarding the fragment at Goats’ Village?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t go by the name Paddi anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.82,0:02:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,this perfect body belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Green is one of our people carrying out the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But he has a unique trait:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he needs to possess a body to unleash his full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That Paddi of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.26,0:03:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,must be the perfect body for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But we still have Tibbie and Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two intruders, Tibbie and Jonie,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,fled into Pink’s manor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,See? You couldn’t catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they’re safe just because of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.09,0:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what that manor really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s not chasing us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Sparky is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to trust Sparky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Our top priority right now is rescuing Mr. Slowy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of place is this, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve been walking for so long, yet we still haven’t found a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:03:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the plants here are really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They scatter when you touch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And they all seem to be drifting toward the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.09,0:04:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.69,0:04:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,that a place like this existed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.01,0:04:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be where Mr. Slowy is trapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This scent…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This flower is the same variety as the ones outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is it that only here…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,are the colors so vivid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there someone here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:04:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn’t a single person in the whole house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no rooms either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The table is spotless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.59,0:05:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The juice is half-drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All the clues suggest
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,that just a moment ago, someone was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.77,0:05:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,where on earth did the people
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,in this house go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.29,0:05:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,None of the paintings here feature a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,except for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a girl in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, Jonie, Jonie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie, answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t lose my head now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a way to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In a manor this big…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.12,0:06:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,there must be other entrances.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.28,0:06:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find an entrance to get in and save Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.87,0:06:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can’t get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This painting is the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I have guessed wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,These paintings don’t lead anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a girl on the back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Something terrible has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from the Flower Tribe tried to snatch my fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They attacked Queen Nuan and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You said someone from the Flower Tribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder the Silt Tribe is demanding justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Flower Tribe wouldn’t try to snatch the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They don’t even know the fragment exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who exactly was it that tried to take the fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.07,0:07:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really just bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If we hadn’t run into some unexpected trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,our Flower Babies would have successfully obtained Sparks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.35,0:07:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Flower Baby trial begins tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.07,0:07:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of space is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She is in every single painting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,that she is the owner of this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Planting flowers, planting flowers…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The person inside is actually moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this so magical?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She can’t see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything has come to a standstill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Could she see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I’d like to ask…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she still not see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the perfect world…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,would have a blue sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The water would be a lush green.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.49,0:09:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d have a stretch of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,green meadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,filled with green trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.64,0:09:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and my favorite Colorful Dandelions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.17,0:10:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems each painting represents a single fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that these paintings…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,all preserve the owner’s memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with her? She was so happy in the earlier painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.64,0:10:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My flower…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,…my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.64,0:10:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the color fading away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This strange plant…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,seems to be the guardian of that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have to go back in and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we’ve been discovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,there’s no need to hide anymore.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
